  "description": "SOBTEK crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P c. Reported CIF formula moiety: 2(C36 H24 Fe1 N6 2+),C7 H7 Cl15 O23 Pr4 Sb12 6-,2(C6 H8 N1 1+),H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Pr1 (Pr) has 5 O neighbors; Pr2 (Pr) has 7 O neighbors; Pr3 (Pr) has 7 O neighbors; Pr4 (Pr) has 7 O neighbors; Fe1 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors; Fe2 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 3 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.813-4.899 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 119.48-124.27°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C91H73.4N14O24.4Cl14.6Fe2Sb12Pr4.",
